   Voice: same as the English original — direct, honest, slightly dry,
   no corporate-speak. Prefer "analyser" to "scanner" except for UI
   actions where "lancer une analyse" reads better than "lancer un
   scan". "Dry run" stays "simulation" because that's the accepted
   French term in this context. */

